  "description": "Enquiries via WhatsApp only please 086-3867631\n\nRENOVATED HOUSE AND FARM\n4 Bed Room Detached House + Stables/Animal Shed + Hay Shed + Grazing Land (0.6 Acres)\n\nFURNISHED\n\nBedroom Rooms x 4 \n\nStable/Animal Shed x 1\n\nHay/ Storage Shed x 1\n\nGrazing Land x 1 (0.6 Acres)\n\nHouse + Stable + Hay Shed (0.4 Acres)\n\nDown Stairs Toilet x 1\n\nLiving Room with Stove x 1\n\nKitchen x 1\n\nUpstairs Bathroom, Shower Toilet x 1\n\n\nThis 2-storey farmhouse .The house itself which is sited on approx 0.4 acre of land with  0.6 acre of land across the road. Remote picturesque setting & yet only 7km from the nearest town of Ballinamore. \n\nFeatures\nElevated mountainside setting\n\nRemote rural setting, only 7km from nearest town of Ballinamore\n\nFolio LM21385F & Folio LM 22286F\n\nDirections\nGoogle Co-ordinates 54.094665840834885, -7.877272367477417\n\nFrom Ballinamore take the road to Aughnasheelin for approx 3km and turn right. Continue for approx 1km Pass through the 1st Crossroads and you will then come to a Y junction. Keep right and travel for a further 2km & take a left turn after the new bungalow. Continue along this roadway for approx 800m until you seethe property located on your left hand side.\n\nLocation\nGoogle Co-ordinates 54.094665840834885, -7.877272367477417\n\nMountain Hide Away Pottore, Aughnasheelin, Co. Leitrim N41 XC95",
